# Terms that must never appear in any outward artifact for this person.
# One per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored. Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# This is how a handling instruction in profile.md becomes a mechanical check
# instead of something you have to remember. If someone asks for a fact to be
# left out, add the words that would reveal it here — including the words that
# would reveal the omission itself.
#
# Example, for someone who asked that their graduation year never appear:
#
#   2019
#   graduation
#   graduated
#
# scripts/preflight.py fails the CV if any of these appears in cv.html,
# cover-letter.html, or any other outward file in the role directory.
